return [====[ORAH · 113</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_arc_recovery" data-title="Arc Recovery"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Arc Recovery</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_ARC_RECOVERY"><h3>Arc Recovery</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / magic_pool</p><p>Kill an AI enemy with Magic damage to restore 5 Magic, up to 100. Cooldown: 2 seconds.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 114</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_arcane_disruption_proc" data-title="Disruptor"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Disruptor</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_1"><h3>Disruptor</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 11% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_2"><h3>Spellbreaker</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / requires Disruptor</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 22% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_3"><h3>Nullifier</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / requires Spellbreaker</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 33% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 115</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_backpedal" data-title="W,A,S,Deborah"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>W,A,S,Deborah</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_WAS_DEBORAH"><h3>W,A,S,Deborah</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move backward 25% faster, including backward diagonals. This affects voluntary ground movement and obeys the ordinary speed cap.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 116</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_cloud_step" data-title="Cloud Step"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Cloud Step</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_CLOUD_STEP"><h3>Cloud Step</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Magic pool</p><p>Once before landing, press Jump in the air for a 3-Magic extra jump with 2× takeoff impulse. Hold a direction for a horizontal boost. Invisible walls block maze shortcuts; Wall Jump takes priority.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 117</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_extracurricular_activity" data-title="Extracurricular Activity"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Extracurricular Activity</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_EXTRACURRICULAR_ACTIVITY"><h3>Extracurricular Activity</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / unowned Magic content</p><p>Learn one new Magic content immediately. Your later scheduled grants remain available.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 118</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_feedback_loop" data-title="Feedback Loop"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Feedback Loop</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_FEEDBACK_LOOP"><h3>Feedback Loop</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / magic_pool</p><p>Each continuation die rolled by your offensive Magic restores 1 Magic. Maximum: 6 per cast, up to 100 Magic. Initial dice do not count.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 119</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_float_on" data-title="Float On"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Float On</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_FLOAT_ON"><h3>Float On</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Magic pool</p><p>Once before landing, hold Jump at your apex to float for up to 3 seconds, spending 5 Magic per second. Release Jump, land or run out of Magic to end it.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 120</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_grand_unified_theory" data-title="Grand Unified Theory"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Grand Unified Theory</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_GRAND_UNIFIED_THEORY"><h3>Grand Unified Theory</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / unowned Magic form</p><p>Learn one new Magic form immediately. Your later scheduled grants remain available.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 121</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_haste" data-title="Haste"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Haste</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_1"><h3>Haste</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Magic pool</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain 100% of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_2"><h3>Mana Rush</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / requires Haste</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain two-thirds of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_3"><h3>Aether Drive</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / requires Mana Rush</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain one-third of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 122</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_mana_spring" data-title="Mana Spring"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mana Spring</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_SPRING"><h3>Mana Spring</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / magic_pool</p><p>After reaching 0 Magic, your next permitted regeneration is 50% faster for 4 seconds. Sustained effects that block regeneration pause this timer.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 123</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_map_movement" data-title="World Walker"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>World Walker</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_WORLD_WALKER_1"><h3>World Walker</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 25% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_GLOBETROTTER_2"><h3>Globetrotter</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 50% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MIND_STRIDER_3"><h3>Mind Strider</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 75% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 124</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_quantum_cost" data-title="Quantum Mathematics"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Quantum Mathematics</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MATHEMATICS_1"><h3>Quantum Mathematics</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 11% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MECHANICS_2"><h3>Quantum Mechanics</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 22% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MASTERY_3"><h3>Quantum Mastery</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 33% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 125</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_russian_asset" data-title="Russian Asset"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Russian Asset</h2><section class="entry" id="CON_RUSSIAN_ASSET"><h3>Russian Asset</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Tetris access</p><p>Double Tetris HP rewards to 20/60/100/160 for 1/2/3/4 lines. Death Tetris lasts up to 120 seconds. The 20-second respawn lock and victory window stay unchanged.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled cooperative heroes with Tetris access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 126</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_size_shifter" data-title="Size Shifter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Size Shifter</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_SIZE_SHIFTER"><h3>Size Shifter</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>Hold Crouch for 3 seconds to shrink your visible body to 33% size. Release to grow back at the same rate. Your ordinary crouched movement hull stays unchanged.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 127</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_summon_management" data-title="Middle Manager"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Middle Manager</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MIDDLE_MANAGER"><h3>Middle Manager</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 2 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_TASKMASTER"><h3>Taskmaster</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 3 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_OVERLORD"><h3>Overlord</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 4 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 128</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-mana_barrier" data-title="Mana Barrier"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mana Barrier</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_1"><h3>Mana Barrier</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 15% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_2"><h3>Arcane Aegis</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Mana Barrier</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 30% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_3"><h3>Mystic Bastion</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / Arcane Aegis</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 45% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 129</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_bleed_proc" data-title="Bloodletter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Bloodletter</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_1"><h3>Bloodletter</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_2"><h3>Deep Wounds</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Bloodletter</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_3"><h3>Exsanguinator</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Deep Wounds</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 130</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_crowbar_crush" data-title="Wrecking Bar"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Wrecking Bar</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_CRUSH"><h3>Wrecking Bar</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Walloper</p><p>Add one die to your Crowbar wall-slam damage. Use the current wall-slam die and its explosion rules.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 131</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_crowbar_damage" data-title="Bash"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Bash</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_D6"><h3>Bash</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Your Crowbar deals exploding d6 damage. Each nonlethal hit attempts a 168-unit physical push.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_D12"><h3>Walloper</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Bash</p><p>Your Crowbar deals SUPER exploding d12 damage. Each nonlethal hit attempts a 168-unit physical push. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 132</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_melee_reach" data-title="Long Reach"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Long Reach</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_MELEE_REACH"><h3>Long Reach</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / melee-family access</p><p>Gain 25% melee reach. Blocking walls, gates and floors still stop the attack.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with melee-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 133</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_pusher" data-title="Pusher"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Pusher</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_1"><h3>Pusher</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 25% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use sealed d8.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_2"><h3>Shover</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Pusher</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 50% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use sealed d10. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_3"><h3>Space Hog</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Shover</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 75% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use SUPER exploding d12. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 134</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_steamroller" data-title="Steamroller"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Steamroller</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_STEAMROLLER"><h3>Steamroller</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires an authored push-capable attack or effect</p><p>Targets that save against your push still move half the size-adjusted distance. Failed saves take full distance. Push immunity, resistance and collision still apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an authored push-capable attack or effect</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 135</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_astral_reach" data-title="Astral Reach"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Astral Reach</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_ASTRAL_REACH"><h3>Astral Reach</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / owns a Magic Form</p><p>Add 2 cells to Magic form dimensions that scale with WIS.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 136</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_attunement" data-title="Attunement"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Attunement</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_ATTUNEMENT"><h3>Attunement</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / owns an elemental Magic attack</p><p>When your elemental Magic exploits a weakness, roll the weakness bonus twice and keep the higher result.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and eligible AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 137</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_breadcrumb_range" data-title="Surveyor"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Surveyor</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SURVEYOR"><h3>Surveyor</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Extend your breadcrumb route by 4 cells. Map degradation and floor restrictions still apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_CARTOGRAPHER"><h3>Cartographer</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Surveyor</p><p>Extend your breadcrumb route by 8 cells. Map degradation and floor restrictions still apply. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 138</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_forceful_magic" data-title="Force Multiplier"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Force Multiplier</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_FORCEFUL_MAGIC"><h3>Force Multiplier</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / magic_push</p><p>Increase your Magic push distance by 25%. Physical push feats require Force of Will to apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with a Magic push</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 139</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_frugal_map" data-title="Frugal Cartography"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Frugal Cartography</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_FRUGAL_MAP"><h3>Frugal Cartography</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Reduce minimap Magic drain by 15%, to a minimum of 3 Magic per second. Magic does not regenerate while the map is open.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 140</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_gps" data-title="GPS"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>GPS</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_GPS"><h3>GPS</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17</p><p>Press G to toggle spoken directions to the current objective; starts enabled and costs no Magic. Stand still for 1 second with no living enemy within 2 same-floor cells to hear a direction. Repeats after 4 seconds of silence. Movement, danger and inactive play stop speech.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 141</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_held_proc" data-title="Snaring"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Snaring</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_1"><h3>Snaring</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_2"><h3>Binding</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Snaring</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_3"><h3>Entrapping</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Binding</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 142</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_hero_of_legend" data-title="Hero of Legend"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Hero of Legend</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_HERO_OF_LEGEND"><h3>Hero of Legend</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>At HP ≥ the lower of 100 or your MaxHP, a Crowbar swing launches a glowing Crowbar that deals your current Crowbar die as non-elemental Magic. Range: at least 1 cell, or your WIS bonus if higher. Only one such projectile may exist at a time.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 143</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_killer_instinct" data-title="Killer Instinct"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Killer Instinct</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_KILLER_INSTINCT"><h3>Killer Instinct</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>After viewing at least two visible enemies for 0.5 seconds, a red outline marks the best target for your equipped weapon: strongest one-shot kill margin, otherwise fewest estimated shots to kill. Rechecks once per second. Losing the multi-enemy view clears it; it grants no aim assistance.</p><p class="actors">Human-controlled Heroes and Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 144</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_mind_over_matter" data-title="Mind Over Matter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mind Over Matter</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_MIND_OVER_MATTER"><h3>Mind Over Matter</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires True Faith</p><p>When ready, reduce incoming physical damage by your positive WIS modifier, once per damage event before Magic diversion. Cooldown: 3d4 seconds; these timing dice do not explode. Damage cannot fall below 0.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 145</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_mute_proc" data-title="Hushing"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Hushing</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_1"><h3>Hushing</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_2"><h3>Silencing</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Hushing</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_3"><h3>Dead Air</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Silencing</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 146</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_omniscience" data-title="Omniscience"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Omniscience</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_OMNISCIENCE"><h3>Omniscience</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17</p><p>Look at a visible monster to see its type, level, class and current/max HP. Human Soldiers retain their player identity above these stats.</p><p class="actors">Human Heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 147</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_reckless_proc" data-title="Agitating"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Agitating</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_1"><h3>Agitating</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_2"><h3>Unhinging</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Agitating</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_3"><h3>Maddening</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Unhinging</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 148</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_sixth_sense" data-title="Sixth Sense"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Sixth Sense</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SIXTH_SENSE"><h3>Sixth Sense</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>See normally visible invisible entities as translucent silhouettes. Outline living enemies within 2 cells on your floor, even through walls. Hear private positional movement sounds from same-floor Watchers. These senses grant no attacks or interactions through walls.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 149</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_spatial_awareness" data-title="Spatial Awareness"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Spatial Awareness</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPATIAL_AWARENESS"><h3>Spatial Awareness</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Warn when an enemy becomes visible behind or beside you on your floor. Rear range: your WIS modifier, minimum 1 cell, in a 3-cell-wide strip; side range: half that, rounded up. A violet direction cue and named alert identify one target; no repeat while it stays detected.</p><p class="actors">Human Heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 150</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_spellward" data-title="Spellward"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Spellward</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLWARD"><h3>Spellward</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Gain +2 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLBREAKER"><h3>Spellbreaker</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Spellward</p><p>Gain +4 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLBANE"><h3>Spellbane</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Spellbreaker</p><p>Gain +6 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 151</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_true_faith" data-title="True Faith"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>True Faith</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_TRUE_FAITH"><h3>True Faith</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Reduce incoming magical damage by your positive WIS modifier, once per damage event after other damage modifiers and before Magic diversion. Damage cannot fall below 0.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 152</div></article><article class="page" id="capstone-fighter" data-title="Fighter capstones"><div class="kicker">Level 20 reference</div><h2>Fighter capstones</h2><section class="entry" id="FTR_CAP_BUILT_DIFFERENT"><h3>Built Different</h3><p class="requirement">Fighter · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Gain 25% ordinary MaxHP before Tetris overfill. Choosing this feat does not heal you.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FTR_CAP_ONE_PERSON_ARMY"><h3>One-Person Army</h3><p class="requirement">Fighter · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Deal 20% more damage with STR-scaled physical attacks, before elemental modifiers.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FTR_CAP_UNSTOPPABLE_FORCE"><h3>Unstoppable Force</h3><p class="requirement">Fighter · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Deal 33% more physical push and receive 25% less. Add one die to valid wall-slam damage.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 153</div></article><article class="page" id="capstone-rogue" data-title="Rogue capstones"><div class="kicker">Level 20 reference</div><h2>Rogue capstones</h2><section class="entry" id="ROG_CAP_ACE_IN_THE_HOLE"><h3>Ace in the Hole</h3><p class="requirement">Rogue · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>After 3 seconds without attacking, your next committed eligible attack gains one primary damage die. That attack consumes the bonus.</p></section><section class="entry" id="ROG_CAP_LOADED_DICE"><h3>Loaded Dice</h3><p class="requirement">Rogue · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Lower Rogue damage-die explosion thresholds by 1. Minimum thresholds, sealed dice and explosion limits still apply.</p></section><section class="entry" id="ROG_CAP_NOW_YOU_SEE_ME"><h3>Now You See Me</h3><p class="requirement">Rogue · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Gain 20 percentage points of Dodge while moving voluntarily at least one-quarter walk speed: 31% normally, 42% at 90% sprint speed. Slower movement grants no Dodge. Roll once per attack and target, before diversion and control.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 154</div></article><article class="page" id="capstone-wizard" data-title="Wizard capstones"><div class="kicker">Level 20 reference</div><h2>Wizard capstones</h2><section class="entry" id="WIZ_CAP_ARCHMAGE"><h3>Archmage</h3><p class="requirement">Wizard · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Increase WIS-scaled offensive Magic power by 20%. Gain +2 DC for resistible Wizard Magic.</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIZ_CAP_LIVING_AEGIS"><h3>Living Aegis</h3><p class="requirement">Wizard · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Arcane Shield spends 1 Magic per 1.5 HP prevented. It still diverts at most 50% of damage. Spell costs and Feedback chance stay unchanged.</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIZ_CAP_MANA_ENGINE"><h3>Mana Engine</h3><p class="requirement">Wizard · Level 20 · choose one</p><p>Regenerate Magic 50% faster after INT scaling, up to 100 Magic. Regeneration must be permitted.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 155</div></article><article class="page" id="fallbacks" data-title="Fallback feats"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Fallback feats</h2><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_CHA"><h3>Make an Impression</h3><p class="requirement">permanent CHA &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic CHA. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_CON"><h3>Tough It Out</h3><p class="requirement">permanent CON &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic CON. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_DEX"><h3>Light Feet</h3><p class="requirement">permanent DEX &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic DEX. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_INT"><h3>Quick Study</h3><p class="requirement">permanent INT &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic INT. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_STR"><h3>Put Your Back Into It</h3><p class="requirement">permanent STR &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic STR. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><section class="entry" id="FALLBACK_WIS"><h3>Keep Your Wits</h3><p class="requirement">permanent WIS &lt; 30</p><p>Permanently gain +1 intrinsic WIS. Repeatable until that intrinsic ability reaches 30.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 156</div></article><article class="page" id="properties" data-title="Equipment property index"><div class="kicker">Equipment reference</div><h2>Equipment property index</h2><table><tr><td>Cha</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Con</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Dex</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Int</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Str</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Wis</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Block Contribution</td><td>Only shield. Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Breadcrumb Cells</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Magic Damage While At/Above 75 Magic</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Damage Reduction</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Dodge Contribution</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Dark Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Earth Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Electric Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Fire Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Ice Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Light Damage</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Damage While At/Below Half Hp</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Magic Damage</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Magic Regeneration Rate</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Map Drain Reduction</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Quickstep</td><td>Only boots. Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Rebuff</td><td>Only ring. Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Movement Speed</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Damage</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Arcane Shattered Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Bleeding Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Clumsy Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Held Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Immolated Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Intimidated Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Muted Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Poisoned Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Push Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Reckless Attempt On Weapon Hit</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Outgoing Push Distance</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Incoming Push Reduction</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Health Regeneration Ceiling</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Health Regeneration Rate</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Cha Condition Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Con Condition Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Dex Condition Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Int Condition Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Str Push Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Wis Condition Saves</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Damage While Moving Below 5 Units/S</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Active Summon Capacity</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Summon Lifetime</td><td>May be positive or a drawback.</td></tr><tr><td>Dark Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Earth Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Electric Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Fire Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Ice Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Light Resistance</td><td>Benefit.</td></tr><tr><td>Dark Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr><tr><td>Earth Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr><tr><td>Electric Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr><tr><td>Fire Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr><tr><td>Ice Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr><tr><td>Light Weakness</td><td>Drawback only.</td></tr></table><p>The item inspection gives the rolled amount. Percentage modifiers, flat ability/save points, fixed wards, and move grants are different units. A hit rider creates an attempt under the ordinary save rules.</p><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 157</div></article></main><script>(function(){
var pages=document.querySelectorAll('.page'), current=0, scrolls={}, font=18, query='', results=[], match=0;
var reader=document.getElementById('reader'), select=document.getElementById('contents');
function call(name){try{if(window.lod&&typeof window.lod[name]==='function'){window.lod[name].apply(window.lod,Array.prototype.slice.call(arguments,1));}}catch(e){}}
function remember(){scrolls[current]=reader.scrollTop;call('position',current,reader.scrollTop,font);}
function show(n,top){n=Math.max(0,Math.min(pages.length-1,parseInt(n,10)||0));remember();pages[current].className=pages[current].className.replace(' active','');current=n;pages[current].className+=' active';select.value=String(n);reader.scrollTop=typeof top==='number'?top:(scrolls[n]||0);document.getElementById('prev').disabled=n===0;document.getElementById('next').disabled=n===pages.length-1;document.getElementById('status').textContent=(n+1)+' / '+pages.length+' · '+pages[n].getAttribute('data-title');remember();}
function scale(n){font=Math.max(15,Math.min(26,n));for(var i=0;i<pages.length;i++)pages[i].style.fontSize=font+'px';remember();}
document.getElementById('prev').onclick=function(){show(current-1);};document.getElementById('next').onclick=function(){show(current+1);};select.onchange=function(){show(this.value);};
document.getElementById('smaller').onclick=function(){scale(font-1);};document.getElementById('larger').onclick=function(){scale(font+1);};
function find(){var q=document.getElementById('search').value.toLowerCase().replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g,'');if(!q)return;if(query!==q){results=[];match=0;query=q;for(var i=0;i<pages.length;i++)if((pages[i].textContent||pages[i].innerText).toLowerCase().indexOf(q)!==-1)results.push(i);}else if(results.length)match=(match+1)%results.length;if(results.length){show(results[match],0);document.getElementById('status').textContent='Match '+(match+1)+' of '+results.length+' · '+pages[current].getAttribute('data-title');}else document.getElementById('status').textContent='No match. Try another word.';}
document.getElementById('find').onclick=find;document.getElementById('search').onkeydown=function(e){if(e.keyCode===13){find();e.preventDefault();}};
reader.onscroll=remember;document.onkeydown=function(e){e=e||window.event;var tag=(e.target||e.srcElement).tagName;if(e.keyCode===27){call('close');e.preventDefault();return;}if(tag==='INPUT'||tag==='SELECT'||tag==='TEXTAREA')return;if(e.keyCode===37){show(current-1);e.preventDefault();}else if(e.keyCode===39){show(current+1);e.preventDefault();}else {call('tab',e.keyCode,e.key||'');if(e.keyCode===80||e.keyCode===73||e.keyCode===76||e.keyCode===79)e.preventDefault();}};
window.LODManual={restore:function(n,top,size){scale(parseInt(size,10)||18);show(n,Math.max(0,Number(top)||0));},go:show};
show(0,0);call('ready');
})();</script></body></html>]====]
